# Server core

- This folder is the API only. Do not edit `../client`.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/`.
- No `/api` prefix. Mounts: `/auth`, `/token`, `/workspaces`, `/boards`, `/tasks`, `/operations`, `/admin`, `/ai`, `/health`.
- Mutating routes: `authenticateToken` + permission middleware + parameterized SQL.
- Errors: `AppError` + `asyncHandler`. Shape `{ success: false, error: { message, code, statusCode } }`.
- Never commit `.env`, `JWT_SECRET`, or Cloudinary/EmailJS keys.
